OL,3,ADivorcing abusive husband cost woman
OL,4,A#105k
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought being stuck in this
OL,7,Frelationship I couldn't get out of
OL,8,Fwould be highlighted within the divorce
OL,9,Fprocedure," Boucher said. "But the
OL,10,Fdivorce law doesn't take into account
OL,11,Fthe fact that he was a criminal."
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said it
OL,14,Fhad begun a consultation to reform the
OL,15,Flaw so "family courts meet the needs of
OL,16,Fdomestic abuse victims".
